  user_1,Right I remember now So how do I go about paying that
  user_2,You can pay online through our website or over the phone with a credit card [hold music starts] 
  user_1,[background noise: dog barks] Sorry about that my dog is being a bit loud
  user_2,[laughs] No worries at all So would you like to pay over the phone
  user_1,Yeah that would be great Can you just confirm the amount again
  user_2,It's a total of ₹25,000 including the outstanding premium of ₹23,000 and a reinstatement fee of ₹2,000 [typing]
  user_1,Okay got it And will my policy be active immediately after payment
  user_2,[pause] Let me just check on that for you [hold music starts]